(drag-runtime-harness)
*title Table-driven drag runtime harness
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=0.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=250.0 gama=0.0 psi=0.0 time=0.0 mass=250.0
  *file drag-runtime.dat time mach alpha cd xecfcdt
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.1 dt=0.1
    *aero cd=(clean-cd)
    *fly alpha=5.0
    *when time>0.2 stop
*end

